  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building and Binding Networks (UMAG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023 was the first cooperation year for UMAG. The project has been in its preparatory phase, strategies and activities have been designed to ensure good outcomes once the implementation begins. The focus has been to establish a foundation for the project, that means the development of frameworks and partnerships, which are very important for achieving behavioural changes.To promote the legacy of Ugur Mamcu, UMAG launched a campaign with different initiatives. They did a public awareness campaign through different media channels to educate people about the effects of corruption on society. UMAG is developing a digital archive and resource centre that contains Ugur Mamcu work which will be easily accessible to researchers, activists and the general public.</narrative>
  </description>
